# Test of Witchcraft (Q229), the six Aklantoth gems: Alexandria sends the traveller for them; Nestle and
# Leopold send it for the skeletal mercenary's three; Lara for the nameless revenant's; Kaira gives one;
# Iker takes the 60 fangs, charms and heartstones (19 of each held already, the last of each killed). The
# sixth gem moves the quest to Orim's third step.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
